  "domain": "tier0/api-probes/phase1-layer-node-kinds",
  "description": "API probe P22-B, layer stack (phase1.24 item 3.4, decision 296): on the plane, a fill layer whose content stack holds a paint effect (insert_paint) and the starter-asset Blur filter (found by the documented resource search 's:starterassets u:filter n:Blur=', as effect-order finds it), and whose black mask holds the starter-asset Metal Edge Wear generator ('s:starterassets u:generator n:Metal Edge Wear='); in the first session and after save/reopen: Node.get_type of each (NodeType PaintEffect, FilterEffect, GeneratorEffect), isinstance of layerstack.EffectNode, LayerNode.instances before and after layerstack.instantiate below the fill, the instance's get_type (NodeType InstanceLayer) and InstanceLayerNode.instance_source, and SelectionType.Properties set and read on the instance and on the fill. UzPainter refuses insert_paint, insert_filter_effect, insert_generator_effect and instantiate (release gaps), so its replay settles these symbols only once those gaps close (decision 296).",
  "inputs": [
    {
      "input_id": "plane",
      "kind": "mesh",
      "path": "parity/fixtures/meshes/plane.obj",
      "sha256": "7d3c5f616c2abf4b06050434fa943d19dcb15ec998245a211d1d4ca7e95197fe",
      "provenance": {
        "origin": "uzmigames_authored",
        "licence": "Apache-2.0"
      }
    }
  ],
  "instruction_sequence": {
    "author": "UzmiGames",
    "interface": "substance_painter_documented_python_api",
    "steps": [
      {
        "step": 1,
        "call": "substance_painter.project.create",
        "args": {
          "mesh": "plane",
          "normal_map_format": "OpenGL",
          "default_texture_resolution": 256
        }
      },
      {
        "step": 2,
        "call": "substance_painter.event.Dispatcher.connect",
